    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST \u26f3</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is it worth it? \ud83d\udc47</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Grab the game at a lower price during launch promotions! \ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Be the first to know about the game's release!\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Help me reach a wider gaming community.\ud83d\ude4c</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Stay up to date with every update!\u26f3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist and get ready for an adventure that\u2019s about to begin! \ud83c\udfcc\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u2728</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/0cb58ae975ac50c5176e47ddad67ec67.avif?t=1744113748\" width=600 height=110 /></span><br><strong>Really Simple Golf</strong> is a climbing platformer golf, that blends chill vibes with precision driven adventure. Embark on an adventure across vibrant courses, mastering tricky shoots, navigating obstacles, and sinking those perfect putts.<br><br>\u26f3 <strong>Looking for a relaxing round?</strong>  Take your time, enjoy the scenery, and perfect your &quot;swing&quot;. Every obstacle offers a unique challenge, perfect for unwinding after a long day.<br><br>\u26f3 <strong>Feeling the need for speed?</strong>  The mechanics of the game allows you to speedrun all the levels. I am very curious about that :D<br><br>\u26f3 <strong>Please help me by adding the game to your wishlist!</strong> The more people add the game to their wishlists, the greater the chance that Steam will show it to more people.<br><br>\u26f3 <strong>Your feedback shapes the game!</strong> I am constantly working to improve the experience, and your feedback is everything to me. Share your thoughts about the game wherever you want. On Steam, Reddit, Discord, X, call me, send a carrier pigeon... you get my point. \ud83d\ude05<br><br>\u26f3 Join the community and have fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/56b7bc98a19ce4ee3c87433256f8cf24.poster.avif?t=1744113748\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/56b7bc98a19ce4ee3c87433256f8cf24.webm?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/56b7bc98a19ce4ee3c87433256f8cf24.mp4?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Physics-based<br></li><li> Precision driven<br></li><li> Easy mechanics<br></li><li> Designed for casual players and hardcore speedrunners<br></li><li> Different levels <br></li><li> Supports many languages (Doing my best with all the translations, apologies in advance)<br></li><li> Some graphic settings for different machines<br></li><li> Feedback is more than welcome</li></ul><br>\u26f3 <strong>You don't have to rush if you don't want to. Just have fun</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/a23f9b9549aa5ab6d6c4eefc1756bdef.poster.avif?t=1744113748\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/a23f9b9549aa5ab6d6c4eefc1756bdef.webm?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/a23f9b9549aa5ab6d6c4eefc1756bdef.mp4?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u26f3 <strong>Enjoy the moment</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/dff5e5f9c3c2304784ac754e9664ae47.poster.avif?t=1744113748\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/dff5e5f9c3c2304784ac754e9664ae47.webm?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/dff5e5f9c3c2304784ac754e9664ae47.mp4?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u26f3 <strong>It's okay if you don't succeed the first time, or even after a few tries...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/e668679df69dc7899b5db3f29d01eece.poster.avif?t=1744113748\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/e668679df69dc7899b5db3f29d01eece.webm?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938330/extras/e668679df69dc7899b5db3f29d01eece.mp4?t=1744113748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's just <strong>Really Simple Golf</strong>.",
